  "note_shares": "Top-decile and cell-best shares depend on cell size (a slot in a small cell is more often its best). A cell's average percentile is always 0.5, but one slot's percentile depends on which other slots its cell holds. Excluded slots' neighbours sit in smaller cells (mean_neighbour_cell_size), so part of the mean-percentile gap may be mechanical; see added_check_complete_neighbour_cells.",
