    ],
    "own_cell_mean_yield_note": "mean over the cell's measured slots, duplicated slots averaged",
    "text": "Scored 14,588 of 31,605 excluded slots (46%). The other 17,017 have no measured T-50 or T+50 neighbour. Compared with the scored ones they sit in smaller cells (mean 8.8 vs 14.4 measured slots), lower-yield cells (mean cell yield 2.52 vs 4.06) and lower-max catalysts (mean observed max 7.03 vs 11.06). 8,979 are never measured at any temperature, so no within-catalyst test covers them. Between-catalyst coupling is reported separately (between_catalyst)."
   },
   "detail": "Per-ratio present-minus-excluded mean-percentile differences are 0.018 to 0.034, below the 0.05 threshold; their CIs exclude zero in 3 of 3 ratios. A small present-minus-excluded difference is detectable; part of it may be cell composition. One slot's percentile depends on which other slots its cell holds, and excluded slots' neighbours sit in smaller cells (mean 20.7 vs 23.5 measured slots). Restricted to neighbours in complete 27-slot cells, the differences are +0.013 [-0.026, +0.053], +0.013 [-0.013, +0.037], +0.022 [+0.002, +0.043] for ratios 2/4/6; the CI excludes zero in 1 of 3 (n excluded 472/791/1,018; low power). The cell-best share points the other way (higher for excluded slots, CI excludes zero) at ratios 2 and 4. Scope: 46% of excluded slots were scored (see scope)."
  },
